{"kind":"html","caption":"把每个字符以及每对相邻字符依次当作回文中心，同时向左右扩展；两端字符相同就继续，首次不同或越界时停止。动画先用「babad」展示奇数长度中心得到「bab」，再用「cbbd」展示偶数长度中心得到「bb」。遍历全部 2n−1 个中心并保留最长区间，时间复杂度为 O(n²)，额外空间为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最长回文子串可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; min-height:auto; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  body{ font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .lead { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .chars { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: stretch; }\n  .cell { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; text-align: center; transition: background .3s, border-color .3s; }\n  .char { font: 700 14px/1.2 \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .index { margin-top: 2px; font: 10px/1.2 \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .marker { min-height: 12px; margin-top: 2px; color: #3794ff; font: 700 10px/1.2 \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .cell.range { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .cell.range .char, .cell.range .index, .cell.range .marker { color: #fff; }\n  .cell.edge { border-color: #d7ba7d; }\n  .cell.mismatch { border-color: #f48771; background: #5a3030; }\n  .status-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .status-grid.compact-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .card { min-height: auto; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: #2d2d30; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; font-size: 11px; color: #8d8d8d; line-height: 1.35; }\n  .label { color: #3794ff; font-size: 10px; }\n  .value { margin-top: 2px; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 13px; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .rule { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #2a2d2e; font-size: 12px; }\n  .rule strong { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #3794ff; font-size: 10px; }\n  .progress { height: 3px; margin-top: 6px; border-radius: 4px; background: #3c3c3c; overflow: hidden; }\n  .progress > div { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; background: #3794ff; }\n  .progress.run > div { animation: fill 2s linear forwards; }\n  @keyframes fill { from { width: 0; } to { width: 100%; } }\n  .complexity { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .pill { padding: 2px 7px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; font-size: 10px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>从中心向两侧扩展</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">一个回文串由中心决定：中心可以是一个字符，也可以是两个字符之间的空隙。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\" id=\"exampleTitle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"chars\" id=\"chars\"></div>\n    <div class=\"status-grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前中心</div><div class=\"value mono\" id=\"center\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">本步判断</div><div class=\"value\" id=\"action\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">目前最长</div><div class=\"value mono\" id=\"best\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rule\"><strong id=\"stepNo\"></strong><span id=\"explain\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"><div></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">为什么要检查两类中心？</div>\n    <div class=\"status-grid compact-2\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">奇数长度</div><div class=\"value mono\">b [a] b</div><div>中心在字符上</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">偶数长度</div><div class=\"value mono\">c [bb] d</div><div>中心在字符间</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"complexity\">\n      <span class=\"pill\">中心数：<span class=\"mono\">2n−1</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pill\">时间：<span class=\"mono\">O(n²)</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pill\">额外空间：<span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span></span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst scenes = [\n  { s:'babad', title:'示例 1：s = \"babad\"', center:'下标 1 的 a', l:1, r:1, state:'range', action:'a = a，可以扩展', best:'\"a\"', explain:'先把单个字符 a 当作奇数长度回文。' },\n  { s:'babad', title:'示例 1：s = \"babad\"', center:'下标 1 的 a', l:0, r:2, state:'range', action:'b = b，继续扩展', best:'\"bab\"', explain:'左右各走一步仍然相同，得到回文子串 \"bab\"，更新最长答案。' },\n  { s:'babad', title:'示例 1：s = \"babad\"', center:'下标 1 的 a', l:0, r:4, edge:[0,4], state:'mismatch', action:'越过 bab 后两端不同', best:'\"bab\"', explain:'下一层无法继续，当前中心的扩展结束；\"aba\" 也会在后续中心被找到。' },\n  { s:'cbbd', title:'示例 2：s = \"cbbd\"', center:'下标 1 与 2 之间', l:1, r:2, state:'range', action:'b = b，可以扩展', best:'\"bb\"', explain:'偶数长度回文没有单个中心字符，要从相邻的两个 b 开始。' },\n  { s:'cbbd', title:'示例 2：s = \"cbbd\"', center:'下标 1 与 2 之间', l:0, r:3, edge:[0,3], state:'mismatch', action:'c ≠ d，停止扩展', best:'\"bb\"', explain:'外侧字符不同，因此这个中心能得到的最长回文就是 \"bb\"。' },\n  { s:'cbbd', title:'遍历完成', center:'全部 2n−1 个中心', l:1, r:2, state:'range', action:'保留最长区间', best:'\"bb\"', explain:'对每个字符中心和每个字符间隙执行同样的扩展，最终返回记录的最长区间。' }\n];\nlet sceneIndex = 0;\nfunction render(scene) {\n  document.getElementById('exampleTitle').textContent = scene.title;\n  document.getElementById('center').textContent = scene.center;\n  document.getElementById('action').textContent = scene.action;\n  document.getElementById('best').textContent = scene.best;\n  document.getElementById('stepNo').textContent = '步骤 ' + (sceneIndex + 1) + '/' + scenes.length;\n  document.getElementById('explain').textContent = scene.explain;\n  const host = document.getElementById('chars');\n  host.innerHTML = '';\n  [...scene.s].forEach((ch, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    if (scene.state === 'range' && i >= scene.l && i <= scene.r) cell.classList.add('range');\n    if (scene.edge && scene.edge.includes(i)) cell.classList.add('mismatch');\n    else if (i === scene.l || i === scene.r) cell.classList.add('edge');\n    let marker = '';\n    if (i === scene.l && i === scene.r) marker = 'L = R';\n    else if (i === scene.l) marker = 'L';\n    else if (i === scene.r) marker = 'R';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"char\">' + ch + '</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ' + i + '</div><div class=\"marker\">' + marker + '</div>';\n    host.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  progress.classList.remove('run');\n  void progress.offsetWidth;\n  progress.classList.add('run');\n}\nfunction next() {\n  render(scenes[sceneIndex]);\n  sceneIndex = (sceneIndex + 1) % scenes.length;\n}\nnext();\nsetInterval(next, 2000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
